OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA drier and
OL,6,Fbrighter evening as patchy rain clears
OL,7,Fto the south. Clear skies for a time
OL,8,Fovernight, before further cloud and
OL,9,Frain pushes in from the west in the
OL,10,Fearly hours. Light and often variable
OL,11,Fwinds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA cloudy and often wet start
OL,14,Fwith a moderate breeze. Rain will ease
OL,15,Fthrough the morning, with isolated
OL,16,Fshowers, mainly over high ground and
OL,17,Fsome brighter spells into the
OL,18,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
