OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FLargely cloudy at first on Monday and
OL,7,FTuesday with spells of rain possible
OL,8,Fat times. A chance of drier and
OL,9,Fbrighter weather from Wednesday and
OL,10,Fturning increasingly warm.
